Open Mapple: the boot loaders. MIT (LICENSE), except SplitBoot's boot menu (below).

- mtk/loader/: mtkloader, from HakiOS (github.com/oosexgang/hakios-xnu-kernel). MIT, Copyright (c) 2025-2026
  the HakiOS authors.
- shim/: viva's boot shim, from ios-viva (github.com/Nik300/ios-viva). MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 dipa-studio.
- shim/qcom/: the Qualcomm shim, from ios-sweet (github.com/dipa-studio/ios-sweet) with the Pixel 4a's board
  support from ios-sweet-pixel (github.com/hellagarage/ios-sweet-pixel). MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 dipa-studio.
- mtk/loader/splitmenu.h and splitmenu_test.c: SplitBoot's boot menu. GPL-3.0-only, Copyright (c) 2026 Pritish
  Joshi (DrtSinX98); the full text is in LICENSES/GPL-3.0. mtkloader.bin built with SPLIT_MENU=1 (SplitBoot's
  loader) includes it and is therefore GPL-3.0; built without it, it is MIT.

Not in this repository: the identity header (made from the user's IPSW when building) and the touch firmware
(pulled from the user's own phone).
